[{"id": 57233421, "text": "Seven different handwriting patterns drawn on lined paper: a repeating v, alternating tall l and small i (without dots), c shapes joined to look like a wave, a curly pattern, upside-down u shapes, a repeating w with alternating tall and short peaks, and a row of joined o shapes.", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 4, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": "patterns_of_vog_image", "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": "patterns_of_vog_image-01FX2H81XK3EG55AB25V6N098N.jpeg", "linkName": null, "stepType": "IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 53155780, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 53155789, "text": "<h2>You will need:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Two pieces of paper with lines (or plain paper and a ruler and pencil);</li>\n<li>Two pencils or pens for writing with.</li>\n<ul>", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 53155780, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 57234167, "text": "An alien standing with some zigzag patterns in front of her.", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 2, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": "vog_and_her_patterns_image", "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": "vog_and_her_patterns_image-01FX2J33H07MGGCW3T00W3AN19.jpeg", "linkName": null, "stepType": "IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 53155780, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 53362058, "text": "<h2>How to Play:</h2>\nThe alien Vog loves patterns. But she doesn't want anyone else to finish a pattern. Your job is to finish some patterns and bravely finish the patterns of Vog!\n<br></br>\n<ol>\n<li>Draw the start of a pattern on your paper. You can make up your own or use one of the suggestions below.</li>\n<li>Swap paper with the other player and finish their pattern by repeating it across the page.</li>\n<li>When one person finished the pattern, the other person says: 'Nobody finishes the patterns of Vog!' Can you say it in a funny voice?</li>\n<li>Swap back 